// microbench entrylabel_post: enumerate every Post (NS2, find start vids by type).
// Reads: the Post collection's keys only (no property); one returned key per Post.
// Evaluator: queries/entry.py _entry_label("Post") -- read_vertices_by_label + count
// (count-final: the harness counts the returned keys).
// mb2 lineage: MB9-10, 19-20, 209-210 (mb2 capped these at LIMIT 10000; this one enumerates all).
FOR x IN Post
    RETURN x._key
